    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0085_398b1bf87311.png\" style=\"width: 450px; height: 254px;\" /><br />Velocity of image of of the point in the first mirror with respect to the image of the point in the second mirror is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><msub><mover><mi>V</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub></mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mfenced><msub><mover><mi>V</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub></mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></math></p>"
